---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="The Relic — Authorization layer for AI agents" description="Governance, policy, and trace audit for AI agents. Install, configure, and govern your agent fleet with The Relic.">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-950 via-gray-950 to-gray-900">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_80%_50%_at_50%_-20%,rgba(12,147,232,0.15),transparent)]" />
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24 sm:py-32 lg:py-40">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
          The authorization layer for AI agents
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-400 sm:text-xl">
          Governance, policy enforcement, and trace audit for your agent fleet. Install once, configure policies, and govern every decision.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
          <a
            href="https://app.therelic.dev"
            class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-relic-500 px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-lg transition hover:bg-relic-600 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-relic-500 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-gray-950 sm:w-auto"
          >
            Get Started
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/therelicai/relic"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-gray-700 bg-gray-900/50 px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-medium text-gray-300 transition hover:border-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-800/50 hover:text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gray-500 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-gray-950 sm:w-auto"
          >
            View on GitHub
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features -->
  <section class="border-t border-gray-800/50 bg-gray-900/30 py-24 sm:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">Built for agent governance</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-400">Everything you need to secure and audit AI agent decisions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mx-auto mt-16 grid max-w-4xl gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-800 bg-gray-950/80 p-8 shadow-xl transition hover:border-relic-500/30">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-relic-500/10 text-relic-400">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Policy Engine</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-400">Define and enforce policies in code. Rego-based rules that gate every agent action before it runs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-800 bg-gray-950/80 p-8 shadow-xl transition hover:border-relic-500/30">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-relic-500/10 text-relic-400">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-3 7h3m-3 4h3m-6-4h.01M9 16h.01" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Trace Audit</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-400">Full visibility into agent decisions. Search, filter, and export traces for compliance and debugging.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-800 bg-gray-950/80 p-8 shadow-xl transition hover:border-relic-500/30">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-relic-500/10 text-relic-400">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Governance Agents</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-400">Proposal workflows and multi-agent governance. Let agents vote on policy changes before they go live.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it Works -->
  <section class="border-t border-gray-800/50 py-24 sm:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">How it works</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-400">Three steps to governed agents.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-4xl">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-12 sm:gap-16">
          <div class="flex gap-6">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-relic-500 text-sm font-bold text-white">1</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Install</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-gray-400">Add the Relic SDK to your agent. One line: <code class="rounded bg-gray-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm text-relic-400">relic trace push</code> — or use our CLI and Go library.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-6">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-relic-500 text-sm font-bold text-white">2</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Configure</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-gray-400">Define policies in Rego. Gate actions, require approvals, or enforce quotas. Policies run before any agent decision executes.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-6">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-relic-500 text-sm font-bold text-white">3</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Govern</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-gray-400">Audit traces, manage proposals, and scale governance with agents that vote on policy changes. Full visibility and control.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pricing -->
  <section class="border-t border-gray-800/50 bg-gray-900/30 py-24 sm:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">Simple pricing</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-400">Start free. Scale when you need to.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mx-auto mt-16 grid max-w-4xl gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-800 bg-gray-950/80 p-8">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Free</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold text-white">$0<span class="text-base font-normal text-gray-500">/mo</span></p>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-400">
            <li>7-day retention</li>
            <li>100 traces/month</li>
            <li>3 agents</li>
            <li>Community support</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://app.therelic.dev" class="mt-8 block w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-700 bg-transparent py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 transition hover:border-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-800/50">Get started</a>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-relic-500/50 bg-gray-950/80 p-8 ring-1 ring-relic-500/20">
          <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-relic-500/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-relic-400">Popular</span>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Team</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold text-white">$50<span class="text-base font-normal text-gray-500">/mo</span></p>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-400">
            <li>30-day retention</li>
            <li>10K traces/month</li>
            <li>25 agents</li>
            <li>Priority support</li>
            <li>Team management</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://app.therelic.dev" class="mt-8 block w-full rounded-lg bg-relic-500 py-3 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-relic-600">Upgrade to Team</a>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-800 bg-gray-950/80 p-8">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Enterprise</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold text-white">Custom</p>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-400">
            <li>1-year retention</li>
            <li>Unlimited traces</li>
            <li>Unlimited agents</li>
            <li>SLA</li>
            <li>SSO & SAML</li>
            <li>Dedicated support</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="mailto:sales@therelic.dev" class="mt-8 block w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-700 bg-transparent py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 transition hover:border-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-800/50">Contact sales</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-8 text-center">
        <a href="/pricing" class="text-sm font-medium text-relic-400 hover:text-relic-300">View full pricing comparison →</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="border-t border-gray-800/50 py-12">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-6 sm:flex-row">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
          <a href="/" class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-400 hover:text-white">Home</a>
          <a href="/pricing" class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-400 hover:text-white">Pricing</a>
          <a href="https://app.therelic.dev" class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-400 hover:text-white">App</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/therelicai/relic" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-400 hover:text-white">GitHub</a>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">© {new Date().getFullYear()} The Relic. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
